## Project Structure

```text
├── CHANGELOG.md                   # Chronological version changelog
├── CONTRIBUTING.md                # Project contribution and governance terms
├── LICENSE                        # Custom proprietary software license
├── SECURITY.md                    # Security vulnerability reporting policy
├── compile.hxml                   # Haxe compiler build configuration
├── changelogs/                    # Detailed milestone release records
│   └── 2026-10-06-v0.1.0-initial.md
├── res/                           # Embedded assets
│   └── fonts/
│       ├── StackSansHeadline-VariableFont_wght.ttf
│       └── symbols.ttf
├── src/
│   ├── Main.hx                    # Entry point & intro sequence controller
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── AudioManager.hx        # Sound synthesis and gain staging
│   │   ├── ChaseCamera.hx         # Spring-arm chase camera with trauma shake
│   │   ├── ControlDiagrams.hx     # Procedural controller & keyboard visualizer
│   │   ├── FontManager.hx         # Font loading and typography registry
│   │   ├── GraphicsManager.hx     # Render scale, shadow, and lighting pipeline
│   │   ├── SaveSystem.hx          # LocalStorage persistence for settings & state
│   │   ├── UIIcons.hx             # Vector UI icon renderer & tile cache
│   │   └── UIManager.hx           # UI views, bumper tabs, sliders, and HUD
│   ├── entities/
│   │   ├── CarMesh.hx             # Procedural player vehicle geometry & wheels
│   │   └── TrafficSystem.hx       # Highway traffic spawning & waypoint AI
│   ├── input/
│   │   └── InputController.hx     # Gamepad/keyboard polling & edge detection
│   ├── physics/
│   │   └── CarPhysics.hx          # Vehicle handling, friction & drift physics
│   └── world/
│       └── Track.hx               # Procedural highway geometry & lift constants
└── web/                           # Production web root & PWA distribution bundle
    ├── index.html                 # App shell with noscript fallback & canvas
    ├── manifest.json              # Web App Manifest (standalone landscape)
    ├── sw.js                      # Cache-first Service Worker
    ├── game.js                    # Compiled JavaScript bundle (generated)
    ├── icon-192.png               # High-DPI PWA icon (192x192)
    ├── icon-512.png               # High-DPI PWA icon (512x512)
    └── intro/                     # Sequential splash branding
        ├── jagofr-rvl-splash.webp # Studio & developer splash graphic (1080p)
        ├── heaps-haxe-splash.webp # Heaps engine splash graphic (1080p)
        └── icons/                 # Screen 3 attribution badge logos
            ├── logo_haxe.webp
            ├── logo_heaps.webp
            └── logo_webgl.webp
```

